{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56815","headline":"高仙盼游洞灵之曲一章（幷序） · 项宗","name":"高仙盼游洞灵之曲一章（幷序）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"玉室焕东霞，紫辇浮绦宸。\n华台何盼目，北宴飞天元。\n清浄太无中，眇眇蹑景迁。\n吟咏大洞章，唱此三九篇。\n曲寝大漠内，神王方寸间，寂室思灵晖，何事苦山林。\n须臾变衰翁，廻爲孩中颜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"项宗","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56815.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56815","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}